                                                "sense_id": "5df39a65-7e0d-3caf-b30d-b289fc652f66",
                                                "text": "If the worſt come to the worſt,—I'll turn my Wife to Graſs—I already have a deed of Settlement of the beſt part of her Eſtate; which I wheadl'd out of her; [...]"
